{"asset_key":"timeline/quest_story_13204040","episode":"timeline","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13204040","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"narration:0:1320404001:0":{"text":"우린 옷을 갈아입고 한참 동안 온천에 푹 들어갔다.","source_cn":"你们换下衣物，在温泉里舒服地泡了好一阵子","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAB15260FA3FD1383","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1320404002:0":{"text":"우와... 온천 정말 좋네요. 몸의 피로가 따뜻한 물에 녹아내리는 것 같아요.","source_cn":"哇……泡温泉好舒服呀，感觉身体里的疲惫都被热气融化了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x543910E6730984AE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1320404003:0":{"text":"하지만 물이 치피에게는 조금 깊어서 몇 번이나 빠졌어요!","source_cn":"不过，这水对满满来说有点深，呛到我好几次！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3E45AA2321689ACF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1320404004:0":{"text":"...바보 치피! 물속에 돌이 저렇게 많은데, 그 위에 앉으면 되잖아.","source_cn":"……笨满满，水里有很多石头，你可以坐在上面。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9A8E25A257D3F99C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1320404005:0":{"text":"온천에 사람이 너무 많아서 좋은 자리는 다 빼앗겼다고!","source_cn":"这可不能怪我！温泉里人那么多，舒适的位置早就被占住了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x88F916065817A5FB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1320404006:0":{"text":"그럼 다음에 사람이 적을 때 다시 와보자! 지금은 여관 사장님에게 감사 인사를 드리러 가야 해~","source_cn":"那等下次人少的时候，你再试试吧！我们现在先去找老板娘，...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB6E5233FD6CFE75E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:14:13020412:0":{"text":"한적한 장소를 찾아 여유롭게 온천욕을 즐기며 피로를 풀었다.","source_cn":"你们找了一块清静的地方，舒服地泡了一会儿温泉。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4FAB2ED07CC11771","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:黑屏字幕":{"text":"블랙 스크린 자막","source":"黑屏字幕","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:漫漫":{"text":"해미","source":"漫漫","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:满满":{"text":"치피","source":"满满","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":12,"localized_text_count":7,"speaker_count":3}}